GetFinancialFact: inputSchema  parameters: -Note that discrete +A fourth quarter the filer never reported on its own is the year less its first three quarters, marked (derived), for income and cash-flow lines; other lines have -exist -a discrete fourth quarter (most large filers stopped after ~2021). +one.
GetTopHolders: inputSchema  parameters: -available; +available, or for a delisted company its last quarter on or before the delisting;
